      "cooked": "<p>One more question for the veterans out there…</p>\n<p>I have some doubts about managing the scene tracker turn and when introducing new threats. So I made a small flowchart to help me in my first ventures into SCRPG.<br>\nDid I get it right?</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/3/33d38e491687a6f1e688b46fef064f61c32c9fa7.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/33d38e491687a6f1e688b46fef064f61c32c9fa7\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/3/33d38e491687a6f1e688b46fef064f61c32c9fa7_2_372x499.jpeg\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"7otBE76Zkqy0qicCfeQmvz59VP1\" width=\"372\" height=\"499\" srcset=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/3/33d38e491687a6f1e688b46fef064f61c32c9fa7_2_372x499.jpeg, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/3/33d38e491687a6f1e688b46fef064f61c32c9fa7.jpeg 1.5x, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/3/33d38e491687a6f1e688b46fef064f61c32c9fa7.jpeg 2x\" data-small-upload=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/3/33d38e491687a6f1e688b46fef064f61c32c9fa7_2_10x10.png\"><div class=\"meta\">\n<svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">493×661 38.6 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg>\n</div></a></div></p>",
