      "created_at": "2021-03-10T14:31:54.656Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Looks fine to me.   Only piece I’d note is that you can still introduce new environment threats even if other ones are already in play.<br>\nEdit: Specifically I’m referring to the step that says “Are three threats in plays”</p>",
